  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees.",
    "Season the chicken thighs with salt and pepper.",
    "Heat a skillet over medium high heat and sear the chicken until browned.",
    "Add the sliced onions to the skillet and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the mushrooms and garlic to the skillet and cook until the mushrooms release their liquid.",
    "Add the lime juice, chocolate, thyme, and bay leaves to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Place the chicken and sauce in individual mini cocottes.",
    "Bake the coq au vin in the preheated oven for 20 minutes."
